\section{Limitations}{

A pooled group has no single residue, so it has no motif and cannot be passed
to \code{add_site_sequence()} or used for kinase and motif enrichment. Downstream
labelling has to carry \code{ptm_group_n_candidates} through to the site labels,
so that a pooled group is never rendered as if it were one residue. Pooling
